  <XDFFUNCTION uniqueid="0x61F2" flags="0x0">
    <title>RPM Error vs Desired RPM Correction Rate</title>
    <description>Defines the Speed of RPM correction (Roughly in RPM/sec) vs the Current Error in Idle Speed.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Think of this as how fast the CL system wants to correct Idle Speed. This does not directly affect any of the P or I gains.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="3" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="31" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x03" mmedaddress="0x14CEE" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedcolcount="7" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>Engine RPM</units>
      <indexcount>7</indexcount>
      <max>0.000000</max>
      <embedinfo type="1" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="X/4">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x14CF0" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedcolcount="7" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>RPM / Sec</units>
      <indexcount>7</indexcount>
      <max>0.000000</max>
      <embedinfo type="1" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
  </XDFFUNCTION>
  <XDFFUNCTION uniqueid="0x5E" flags="0x0">
    <title>ISC P Gain vs Idle RPM Error</title>
    <description>This is the Proportional Gain of the Closed Loop Idle Control System vs the current Idle Speed Error. You can think of the Gain value as doing the following:&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Correction = Desired + (Error x Gain) where Gain is the result of this function.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Tune this like any other PID system. This value will control the rate at which the EEC responds to instant Idle Speed Error using the P component of the PID algorithm.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="3" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="31" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x03" mmedaddress="0x14B40" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedcolcount="7" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>RPM Error</units>
      <indexcount>7</indexcount>
      <max>0.000000</max>
      <embedinfo type="1" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="X/4">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x14B42" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedcolcount="7" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>P Gain</units>
      <indexcount>7</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>3</decimalpl>
      <max>0.000000</max>
      <embedinfo type="1" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="X/16384">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
  </XDFFUNCTION>
