  <XDFPATCH uniqueid="0x23A">
    <title>Replace VE Load with MAP</title>
    <description>Replaces the Normalised Load scaling for the VE table with MAP, which is much simpiler to tune when a Moats QH (To read the current normalised load) is not available.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Note that Normalised load will still be used to scale the AFR target tables, so it should still be correctly setup. This will only enable simplier tuning of the VE table.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="5" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="81" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="2" category="1" />
    <XDFPATCHENTRY name="Replace Scaler" address="0x25A18" datasize="0x4" patchdata="A366503A" basedata="A3664C3A" />
