  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x6076" vislevel="1" flags="0x0">
    <title>Maximum Acceptable Overadvance</title>
    <description>This is the maximum amount of advance BEYOND MBT spark advance stored in the MBT advance tables the knock system can command at a given Load (MAP) and RPM. Some factory bins populate this, others don&apos;t.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Use this table to allow the Knock control system to EXCEED the spark advance limits of the MBT tables by the maximum amount you enter here. The Knock Control System will then advance timing up to MBT Limits + This tables values when it identify&apos;s headroom is available.</description>
