  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x3ED7" flags="0x0">
    <title>OL Fuel Target - N over Load Term</title>
    <description>This is the LAMSE target dependent on Load and Engine Speed. If the Lambda values in this table are lower than the Lambda values in the Temperature over Load Term table, then these values will be used, otherwise the Temperature over Load Term table values are used.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;When you setup your fueling, you should use the engine cold table for warmup, then when you wish to transition to using this tables values, add a row of 1.0 lamda target (or 14.64 AFR target) to the desired columm of the Temperature over Load Term table which will cause this table to take control of the LAMSE target.</description>
