    <description>Open Loop Fuel Target - Engine Coolant Temperature Cold.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Open Loop AFR / Lambda Target used when the Engine Coolant Temperature is below the Desired ECT and has not passed through Desired ECT once since the engine started.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Basiclly, this is the OL target for when the engine is still cold / warming up.</description>
