  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1724" flags="0x0">
    <title>OL Fuel Target - Temperature over Time Term (AFR)</title>
    <description>Open Loop Fuel Target - Engine Startup Enrichment Offset.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Lambda / AFR Offset applied when the engine is first started. Values in this table are the values subtracted from the OL Fuel Target to enrich the mixture.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;0 = No fueling changes&#013;&#010;&gt;0 = Lambda or AFR Value subtracted from Base OL target to enrich mixture.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="2" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="50" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="2" category="60" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>deg C</units>
      <indexcount>10</indexcount>
      <embedinfo type="2" linkobjid="0x703B" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>secs</units>
      <indexcount>8</indexcount>
      <embedinfo type="2" linkobjid="0x6C69" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="z">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x137EC" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedrowcount="8" mmedcolcount="10" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>A/F ratio</units>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <min>0.000000</min>
      <max>255.000000</max>
      <outputtype>1</outputtype>
      <MATH equation="14.64 - (X/128*14.64)">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
  </XDFTABLE>
  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x34A2" flags="0x0">
    <title>OL Fuel Target - Temperature over Time Term</title>
    <description>Open Loop Fuel Target - Temperature over Time Term (Startup Adder).&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;This is the LAMSE target dependent on ECT over ACT (Effective Engine Temperature) and Engine Run Time. This table is designed to override the values of the N over Load Term and Temperature over Load Term Tables when the engine first starts, otherwise reffered to as after start enrichment in a conventional ECU.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;It is recommended to fill this table with Lambda Values of 1.0 until you have tuned the N over Load Term and Temperature over Load Term tables to your liking. Then, this table can be used to add additional ASE for initial startup where required by having values lower than the other tables.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;It is recommended to ensure the bottom row stays at 1.0 otherwise this tables override value is used up to the engine run timer counter limit of 255 seconds.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="2" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="50" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="2" category="59" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>deg C</units>
      <indexcount>10</indexcount>
      <embedinfo type="2" linkobjid="0x703B" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>secs</units>
      <indexcount>8</indexcount>
      <embedinfo type="2" linkobjid="0x6C69" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="z">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x137EC" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedrowcount="8" mmedcolcount="10" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>A/F ratio</units>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <min>0.000000</min>
      <max>255.000000</max>
      <outputtype>1</outputtype>
      <MATH equation="1 - (X/128)">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
  </XDFTABLE>
  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x6511" flags="0x0">
    <title>OL Fuel Target - Lean Cruse Mode (AFR)</title>
    <description>Open Loop Fuel Target - Lean Cruse Mode.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Open Loop Fuel Target for when the engine is operating in Lean Cruse / MPG mode. In Lean Cruse mode, the engine will follow this fuel mixture or run in closed loop fueling and will also use the Economy spark tables.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;The goal of both of these changes is to increase power to the maximum amount for a given fuel amount injected during crusing to improve economy.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="2" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="50" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="2" category="60" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>rpm</units>
      <indexcount>12</indexcount>
      <embedinfo type="2" linkobjid="0x1EC1" />
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
