  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x2452" vislevel="1" flags="0x0">
    <title>HEGO Gain</title>
    <description>This table defines the HEGO Desired or Base Gain. This controls how much the EEC attempts to swing the HEGO sensor from the switch point based on how quickly it last switched.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Increasing these values effectly increases how agressivly the EEC adjusts target lambda to make the O2 sensor switch again. Increasing can help a lazy sensor (Especially when it is further downstream in the exhaust vs factory)</description>
