  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x73D" flags="0x0">
    <title>Open Loop LPG Stepper Position Commanded</title>
    <description>During Open Loop LPG operation, this is the commanded position of the Secondary LPG flow Stepper Motor, which effectivly controls LPG flow through the engine.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;0 = Full Open&#013;&#010;255 = Full Closed&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Change to adjust LPG fueling when it is not being controlled via the HEGO.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;To learn more about the LPG system and how this table controls it, read the document at:&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;https://fordforums.com.au/wsmpub/augx/Part%2019-2.html</description>
