  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x3094" flags="0x0">
    <title>Open Loop LPG Stepper Position Commanded - Lean Cruise</title>
    <description>During Open Loop LPG operation, this is the commanded position of the Secondary LPG flow Stepper Motor, which effectivly controls LPG flow through the engine. This table is used when the EEC requests Lean Cruise on LPG.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;0 = Full Open&#013;&#010;255 = Full Closed&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Change to adjust LPG fueling when it is not being controlled via the HEGO.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;To learn more about the LPG system and how this table controls it, read the document at:&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;https://fordforums.com.au/wsmpub/augx/Part%2019-2.html</description>
