  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x35E9" flags="0x0">
    <title>Adaptive Learning Fuel Table (LPG)</title>
    <description>Adaptive Learing LTFT delay control table for LPG fuel. Non-LPG bins will show the same values as the petrol delay here.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Values specify for a given cell how long STFT should run before creating a LTFT value. Increase to allow STFT more time to work out what the correction to fueling should be. Set a 0 to disable adaptive learning in a cell.</description>
