    <description>Used in the Poorly documented Torque Management portion of the EEC-V ECM. This is presumably the Base Torque Table used to determine the engines current output in a standard set of condtions. The table is mainly used as a means of controlling the shift pressure behavour and other transmission related functions. It is also used to prevent exceeding of the Transmissions torque limit.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Scale is configured to reflect Newton Meters.</description>
