    <description>The desired time target for adaptive shifting. This is the base timing that Adaptive Shift will attempt to force the transmission to follow. Scaled to show seconds.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Columns are the current gear, or if there is an issue or failure management is active, only column 5 is used.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Lower values tell adaptive shift to shift quicker.</description>
