  <XDFFUNCTION uniqueid="0x14ED" vislevel="1" flags="0x0">
    <title>MAP Transfer Function</title>
    <description>Voltage to Manifold Air Pressure Transfer Function. Change when upgrading to a sensor with more pressure range.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;For static response sensors it is recommended to just set the low and high voltages and pressures in rows 4 and 5. Then use Row 6 to set the maximum voltage (Normally just 5.12) and the maxiumum pressure of your sensor. Keep in mind that you will still need to change the MAP table scalers so the ECU can make use of the added pressure range in its tables.</description>
