  <XDFFUNCTION uniqueid="0x5B45" flags="0x0">
    <title>ECT Threshold to begin BDLN Retard</title>
    <description>This function controls the threshold ECT temperature, after which ECT retard begins. Think of this as the midway point for ECT. If ECT gets lower than this than timing is added to Borderline. If ECT gets higher than this, timing is taken away.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Input is EGR Flow&#013;&#010;Output is ECT Threshold to begin spark retard from BDLN</description>
