  <XDFFUNCTION uniqueid="0x4206" flags="0x0">
    <title>Injector Cranking PW Mutliplier vs Time</title>
    <description>Multiplies the Cranking Injector Puslewidth vs the time the engine has been cranking.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Tweak to change how much effect the amount of time cranking has on the Cranking Injector Pulse Width. In factory bins this function is used to disable the injectors for a brief peroid to prevent flooding the engine after about 16 seconds. They are then re-enabled at 50% of the base PW after 32 seconds.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="3" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="33" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
