  <XDFPATCH uniqueid="0x7337">
    <title>Scale BTR Engine Torque Tables with TPPER</title>
    <description>This patch deletes the BTR estimated torque logic from the Line Pressure Bump Tables and replaces the Load Scaling with the much more simple TP Percentage Value.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;This patch will make the code change and automaticlly enter sensable values in the table scalar. Make sure to use the Line Pressure Tables Labled with (TPPER).</description>
