    <title>Relative TP Voltage Threshold for Part Throttle</title>
    <description>The Throttle Position Voltage Threshold that when exceeded, triggers EEC to change to its part throttle mode.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Note, this is relative Throttle Position voltage. Current TPS Voltage - RATCH.</description>
