  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x27BA">
    <title>TP Voltage Hysterisis for Part Throttle</title>
    <description>The Hysterisis for the PT mode Threshold. The TP voltage must be higher than TP Threshold for Part Throttle + This value to actually engage PT mode. To disengage PT mode, the TP voltage has to drop below the TP Threshold only.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="6" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="77" />
