    <description>This is a multiplier applied to the Maximum Break Torque spark to correct it due to thermal changes. The ACT / ECT fraction is controled via the ECT / ACT Fraction for MBT Thermal Correction scaler, which defines how much ECT or ACT contributes to the result.</description>
