  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x2FBB">
    <title>Injector Minimum PW</title>
    <description>Lowest Acceptable Injector PW. If a lower pulsewidth is commanded, it will be clamped to this value.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Values higher than 0 will also break deceleration fuel cutoff as the 0 ms commanded will be bypassed. Exceeding a value of around 2.50 to 3.00ms here will affect idle fueling on a stock injectors car.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="6" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="79" />
