  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x6CEC">
    <title>Minimum Time Between DFSO Events</title>
    <description>The minimum time that must be spent in Part Throttle Mode, before DFSO can be allowed again.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;This can be used to prevent DFSO engagements if the driver only breifly touches the pedal.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;0 = DFSO always permitted after &quot;Closed Throttle Time Before Shutoff&quot;</description>
