    <description>The amount of fuel returned per step when DFSO has disabled.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Step is Fraction Returned Per Step. If DFSO Initially returns with a fuel multiplier of 0.5 the step amount is added every step till 1.0 is reached.</description>
