      <VAR id="X" />
    </MATH>
  </XDFCONSTANT>
  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x580">
    <title>Underspeed Netural Idle Integral Gain</title>
    <description>This is the Integral Gain of the Closed Loop Idle Control System used when the car is in Netural and the engine is &quot;underspeed&quot;, which in EEC terms means the engnine has fallen below a critical RPM threshold and is about to stall.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Tune this like any other PID system. This value will control the rate at which the EEC responds to RPM error over time.</description>
