    <title>TB Airflow Constant</title>
    <description>Airflow Constant of the Throttle Body. This is an estimate of the amount of air going through the throttle body when the Idle Speed Valve is closed and the Throttle is shut. &#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;This tells the Idle Speed Control system how much of the air entering the engine is caused by the base airflow of the throttle body.</description>
