  <XDFFLAG uniqueid="0x7545">
    <title>Torque Based Throttle Percentage</title>
    <description>Defines if the EEC uses the true throttle percentage measured from the TPS sensor, or uses a table to create a synthetic throttle percentage from Calculated Engine Torque.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;This will greatly affect the BTR.&#013;&#010;Set = Use Torque Based Calculated Throttle Opening&#013;&#010;Not Set = Use Real Throttle Opening %</description>
