    <description>This COULD be the ACT Fraction used to Calculate ECT/ACT for the Fuel Base Table.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;As per the V8 bin files. This controls how much effect the Air Charge Temperature has on the Fuel Base Table by controlling its effect on calculating ECT/ACT.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;A value of 0 indicates only ECT is used.</description>
