    <description>A table providing a correction to the Initial OL Gate Duty table based on Current MAP vs Desired MAP.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;This is effectivly a correction for Turbocharger Lag used in conjuntion with the Spark Kicker to Spool the turbo faster.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Desired MAP is Columns.&#013;&#010;Current MAP is Rows.</description>
