    <description>This scaler provides an absolute minimum value to LAMBSE, effectivly restricting how Rich the car is allowed to operate.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Change to adjust the minimum commandable lambda, this will also affect the amount that closed loop operation is alowed to bias lambda by.</description>
