    <description>Defines if Lambse is permitted to exceed 1.000 in standard condtions, I.e. When beyond 1.000 is commanded by the main fuel tables.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Set = Lambda will never be leaner than 1.000, unless Lean Cruise or Closed Loop Fueling is active&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Not Set = Lambda leaner than 1.000 is always permitted</description>
