  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x6406">
    <title>Cylinder Head Overheat - Cylinders to Disable When Critical</title>
    <description>The number of cylinders that wil be disabled when CHT has exceeded the Critical Threshold On Threshold for the amount of time defined in Critical Threshold Time Before Enable&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;A value of 3 will allow all 6 cylinders to run exactly half the time. A value of 6 will forcably disable fuel to all cylinders (Shutting down the engine).</description>
