  <XDFPATCH uniqueid="0x3AB8">
    <title>Advanced HEGO Mode</title>
    <description>Enables Advanced HEGO Mode, which put simpily allows for fulltime adjustment of the HEGO switchpoint via table.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;In stock narrowband form, this allows biasing the Lambda that the Closed Loop Targets at a given point.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;With more creative use of the techedge wideband product, this allows for psuedo wideband oxygen control by using the switchpoint table as an effective lambda setpoint table in closed loop (This is described in a dedicated guide).</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="5" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="81" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="2" category="15" />
    <XDFPATCHENTRY name="Midnight HEGO SP Helper" address="0x2FD40" datasize="0x1A" patchdata="A366503AA3664E38AD0C3C455C12F440EF494D1142C3729042F0" basedata="FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF" />
    <XDFPATCHENTRY name="LCALL Midnight Helper" address="0x24EA6" datasize="0xE" patchdata="EF97AEFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF" basedata="A3F450269BF5810D00DF0731ED04" />
  </XDFPATCH>
