    <title>Patched EGO Switch Point vs RPM and MAP (Counts)</title>
    <description>When Patched, defines the Switchpoint (In Counts) of the o2 sensor.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;In stock form this can be used to bias towards a non stoich lambda in CL. In non stock form (Custom techedge hardware hack) use the setpoint table.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Lower count values are More Rich&#013;&#010;Higher count values are More Lean&#013;&#010;The stock sensor is at stoich @ approx 690 counts</description>
