  <XDFFLAG uniqueid="0x1165">
    <title>Invert EGO Input</title>
    <description>Defines if the input pin for the o2 sensor should be inverted or not. When using the advanced HEGO patch with a techedge, you need to turn this off.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Set = Pin is Inverted (1.6v internally is 0v, visa versa)&#013;&#010;Not Set = Raw Input is used directly&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Factory is set here, due to the design of the stock sensor.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="5" />
