    <description>Defines if a breach of the low load limit for Lean Cruise will also use the Load Limits Disable Delay, or if Low Load will instantly cause Lean Cruise to Disable.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Not Set = Lean Cruise exits instantly when low load limit is breached&#013;&#010;Set = Lean Cruise exits only after the amount of time in Load Limits Disable Delay when the Low Limit is Breached.</description>
