  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x4ED3" flags="0x0">
    <title>NGICX - Correction Factor for Non Linear Airflow</title>
    <description>For NGICX with slope based airflow, this table provides a correction to the final mass airflow result to account for non linear airflow effects caused by turbulance, ramming, quadratic losses, etc.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;This is mostly because more advanced slope terms are not possible without hardware divide, instead it is easier to correct things with a 3d table multiplier.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="1" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="18" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="2" category="121" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>rpm</units>
      <indexcount>12</indexcount>
