  <XDFFUNCTION uniqueid="0x7211" flags="0x0">
    <title>NGICX - MAF Inverse ACT Correction</title>
    <description>The inverse of a standard ideal gas law thermal correction to MAF as measured at the MAF sensor, used only by the process of calculating MAP from MAF.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;This is done due to EEC technical limitations.</description>
